===Iran vs Nigeria===
The two teams had met in one previous match, in the 1998 [[Lunar New Year Cup]], won 1–0 by Nigeria.<ref>{{cite web|title=2014 FIFA World Cup – Statistical Kit |url=https://www.fifa.com/mm/document/fifafacts/mencompwc/51/97/38/2014fwc_kit_matches_neutral.pdf#page=19 |website=FIFA.com |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association |page=19 |url-status=dead |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20140629232249/http://www.fifa.com/mm/document/fifafacts/mencompwc/51/97/38/2014fwc_kit_matches_neutral.pdf |archivedate=29 June 2014 }}</ref>

In a goalless game of few chances, Iran's [[Reza Ghoochannejhad]] forced a save from [[Vincent Enyeama]] in the first half, while Nigeria substitute [[Shola Ameobi]] headed wide in the second half.<ref>{{cite news |first=Saj |last=Chowdhury|title=Iran 0-0 Nigeria |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/0/football/25285113 |publisher=BBC Sport (British Broadcasting Corporation) |date=16 June 2014 |accessdate=28 December 2014 }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |first=Sid |last=Lowe |title=Nigeria and Iran lower World Cup pulse with forgettable goalless draw |url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2014/jun/16/iran-nigeria-world-cup-2014-group-f-match-report |work=The Guardian |publisher=Guardian News and Media |date=16 June 2014 |accessdate=30 October 2014 }}</ref>

This was the first goalless match as well as the first draw of the tournament after the previous 12 matches all produced a winner, and was the longest wait for a draw in a single tournament since [[1930 FIFA World Cup|1930]], where there were no draws in the entire tournament.<ref>{{cite news |first=Fraser |last=Masefield |title=World Cup - Bore draw does nothing for Iran or Nigeria |url=https://uk.eurosport.yahoo.com/news/world-cup-iran-nigeria-matchpack-surprise-packages-142308534--sow.html |publisher=Yahoo! Sport |date=16 June 2014 |accessdate=28 December 2014 }}</ref> This was also the first clean sheet kept by Iran in the World Cup.<ref>{{cite web |title=Haghighi: Iran excel in tough situations |url=https://www.fifa.com/worldcup/news/haghighi-iran-excel-in-tough-situations-2379167 |website=FIFA |accessdate=27 October 2020 |date=21 June 2014}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |last1=Delaney |first1=Miguel |title=Iran 0 Nigeria 0 match report: Unlucky 13 for World Cup as Carlos Queiroz masterminds first stalemate of tournament |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football/international/iran-0-nigeria-0-match-report-unlucky-13-world-cup-carlos-queiroz-masterminds-first-stalemate-tournament-9541991.html |archive-url=https://ghostarchive.org/archive/20220501/https://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football/international/iran-0-nigeria-0-match-report-unlucky-13-world-cup-carlos-queiroz-masterminds-first-stalemate-tournament-9541991.html |archive-date=1 May 2022 |url-access=subscription |url-status=live |accessdate=27 October 2020 |work=The Independent |date=17 June 2014}}{{cbignore}}</ref>

